        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Migration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. Most migrants travel short distances (distance-decay)\n2. Migration proceeds step by step (urban hierarchy climbing)\n3. Long-distance migrants prefer commercial/industrial centers\n4. Each migration stream produces a compensating counter-stream\n5. Urban natives are less migratory than rural natives\n6. Females predominate in short-distance migration; males in long-distance\n7. Economic motives predominate"
    },
